        <p class="tagline">Elite Competitor | Strategic Analyst | Community Leader</p>
    </header>

    <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Professional Summary</h2>
        <p>
            Highly skilled and dedicated professional gamer with over 8 years of competitive experience in high-stakes environments. 
            Proven track record of strategic excellence, rapid decision-making, and exceptional mechanical skill. 
            Expert in team coordination, meta-analysis, and performance optimization under pressure.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Core Competencies</h2>
        <div class="skills-grid">
            <div class="skill-item">Strategic Planning</div>
