        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <div class="experience-item">
            <h3>Lead Strategist & Competitor</h3>
            <p class="date">2020 - Present</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Consistently ranked in the top 0.1% of global leaderboards in primary competitive titles.</li>
                <li>Led multi-disciplinary teams to victory in regional tournaments and online qualifiers.</li>
                <li>Developed and executed complex tactical frameworks adopted by community peers.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-item">
            <h3>Content Creator & Community Manager</h3>
            <p class="date">2018 - 2020</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Built and managed a dedicated community of 5,000+ members across multiple platforms.</li>
                <li>Produced high-quality educational content focusing on advanced mechanics and strategy.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Technical Arsenal</h2>
        <p><strong>Hardware:</strong> Custom-built high-performance rig, low-latency peripherals, 240Hz display.</p>
        <p><strong>Software:</strong> OBS Studio, Advanced Analytics Tools, Team Communication Suites (Discord/Teamspeak).</p>
    </section>

    <a href="/bence" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Bence's Profile</a>
</div>

